  (text "BUS 1 / FDCAN1 / PROPULSION CONTROLLER (FAJITA) / J501"
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 15.24 144.78 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.524 1.524))
      (justify left))
    (uuid "33bdf9a3-1bd0-5785-b7b7-075d8490f87e"))
  (text "120 ohms is the fixed endpoint termination. Keep CAN H/L twisted up to the connector; the third conductor is the reference return.\nEach reference contact reaches GND only through R516 / F501 (bus 1) or R517 / F502 (bus 2): footprints for a\nresistor and a resettable fuse, 0R until the bench sets values inside the TCAN3413 common-mode range (B-39)."
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 15.24 472.44 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.15 1.15))
      (justify left))
    (uuid "77b34eab-c9a4-5099-aa02-b674177de658"))
  (text "CAN / SWITCHED POWER / LOGIC BOUNDARIES / TWO BUSES"
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 15.24 16.51 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 2.54 2.54))
      (justify left))
    (uuid "92183f44-2044-51ae-9b7d-e02c2abc0f4b"))
  (text "The switched rail and TXU stop signal back-powering. Common source/ground faults remain; first-PCBA cable/fault tests are still required."
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 15.24 481.33 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.15 1.15))
      (justify left))
    (uuid "a1ed28a1-93d3-53b1-83f8-0c88a32b7f2e"))
  (text "BUS 2 / FDCAN2 / ACTIVE BOARD / J502"
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 15.24 309.88 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.524 1.524))
      (justify left))
    (uuid "b842d227-fe7a-5a22-be2c-faba4027c8ed"))
  (text "What this does: Connects the flight MCU to the propulsion controller (bus 1, FDCAN1, J501) and to the active board\n(bus 2, FDCAN2, J502), each over its own wired CAN pair.\nConnects to: Flight CAN pins -> switched transceivers -> Harwin Gecko-SL H / L / reference. Each link is two nodes at\n500 kbit/s; neither connector supplies power. Both transceivers share CAN_3V3 (PB1) and standby (PE10)."
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 15.24 27.94 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.4 1.4))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "e82aae5e-1153-5dfe-964c-b697d9495d3a"))
